        "description": "### Unprocessable Entity - Identify business errors that can be detailed according to backend system rules.\n---\n__The possible values are:__\n* API-CSGSERVICEUSAGESHISTORICALS-001: Subscriber not found.\n* API-CSGSERVICEUSAGESHISTORICALS-002: Subscriber 5511999999999 does not have enough usage history. Active for less than 1 month.",
